---
/* ============================================================
   Bearings — /strategy (strategist reflection)

   Deliberately its own entry point and not linked from the shelves.
   This is a working page for when an experience or a stretch of days
   has left you pulled two ways — you answer what you want to, choose a
   lens, and get a plain reading: what you wrote, back in your own
   words, with a few fixed questions and things you might check on.

   It never interprets what happened. Nothing is owed. There is no
   version of using this page correctly.

   Like /sessions, it runs entirely on this device. Nothing typed here
   is sent anywhere, and it is not discoverable from the main shelves —
   it is in the nav for those who seek it out.

   Not linked from shelves for the same reason as sessions: the default
   path should remain light. This is for the smaller case of someone
   doing repeated, deliberate, solo work.
   ============================================================ */
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import StrategyReflection from "../components/StrategyReflection.svelte";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Strategy — Bearings"
  description="An optional working page for when an experience or a stretch of days has left you pulled two ways — you answer what you want to, choose a lens, and get a plain reading."
  section="strategy"
>
  <section class="reading">
    <p class="kicker">On this device only</p>
    <h1>Strategy</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      An optional working page for when an experience or a stretch of days
      has left you pulled two ways. You answer what you want to, choose a
      lens, and get a plain reading: what you wrote, back in your own words,
      with a few fixed questions and things you might check on.
    </p>
    <p>
      It never interprets what happened. Nothing is owed, and there is no
      version of using this page correctly.
    </p>
    <p>
      It runs entirely on this device. Nothing you type is sent anywhere.
    </p>
    <p class="detail">
      Everything below is stored unencrypted in this browser, like the rest of
      your notes. Anyone with access to this device and an unlocked browser can
      read it. Settings has a copy-out and a delete-everything.
    </p>
  </section>

  <StrategyReflection client:load />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  section {
    margin-top: var(--space-5);
  }
  .detail {
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: var(--size-sm);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    padding-left: var(--space-3);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--rule);
  }
</style>
